OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F431A1786551523
OL,3,CPeople line streets for glasses as
OL,4,CWales prepares for solar eclipse
OL,6,FPeople queued outside one photography
OL,7,Fshop in Colwyn Bay after the business
OL,8,Fannounced it would have 400 pairs of
OL,9,Feclipse-viewing glasses in stock on
OL,10,FWednesday morning.
OL,12,FPaul Davies, who works at Cambrian
OL,13,FPhotography, said he was shocked to
OL,14,Fsee how many people were there waiting
OL,15,Ffor glasses when he arrived to work.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G2/6
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
