FL,432,430,260,120,000,100
PN,43103
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F431A1786551523
OL,3,CPeople line streets for glasses as
OL,4,CWales prepares for solar eclipse
OL,6,FHe said: "We had a rough idea when the
OL,7,Fphone calls started coming in
OL,8,Fyesterday but coming up into work this
OL,9,Fmorning and seeing the queue go around
OL,10,Fthe corner, it's just sort of taken
OL,11,Four breath away.
OL,13,F"One thing we always try and do,
OL,14,Fespecially for our local community is
OL,15,Fprovide things like this. It's great
OL,16,Ffor business but also that we can
OL,17,Fprovide these glasses for the local
OL,18,Fcommunity as well."
OL,20,FThe shop had a 'two per person' limit
OL,21,Fbut still sold out.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G3/6
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
