OL,3,CPeople line streets for glasses as
OL,4,CWales prepares for solar eclipse
OL,6,FWhere are the best spots to watch it
OL,7,Fin Wales?
OL,9,FRanking at the top, West Pembrokeshire
OL,10,Fis set to experience 94% to 96% of sun
OL,11,Fcoverage, with Strumble Head named the
OL,12,Fsecond best viewing spot in the UK
OL,13,Faccording to a study by SIXT.
OL,15,FAcross the rest of Wales, the sun will
OL,16,Fbe between 92% and 94% covered.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G4/6
OL,2,W+.-'*%/"-$+,(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
