CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F431A1786551523
OL,3,CPeople line streets for glasses as
OL,4,CWales prepares for solar eclipse
OL,6,FRhossili Bay on Gower was placed sixth
OL,7,Fbest in the same study, whilst Craig
OL,8,FGoch Dam in the Elan Valley has also
OL,9,Fbeen highlighted as a prime viewing
OL,10,Flocation.
OL,12,FIn Cardiff, the eclipse will reach its
OL,13,Fpeak at 19:13, with the moon covering
OL,14,F93.24% of the sun.
OL,16,FWales will experience a partial
OL,17,Feclipse, while parts of Iceland,
OL,18,FGreenland and Spain will see a total
OL,19,Feclipse.
OL,21,FWhat happens after the eclipse?
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G5/6
