OL,3,CPeople line streets for glasses as
OL,4,CWales prepares for solar eclipse
OL,6,FNightfall is likely to bring even more
OL,7,Fspectacle, as the Perseid meteor
OL,8,Fshower is set to peak later into the
OL,9,Fevening.
OL,11,FWhile the shower spans from July 17 to
OL,12,FAugust 24, its maximum activity is
OL,13,Fexpected overnight on August 12.
OL,1,Wj5hw}j5 ~shws                   G6/6
